---
// Exactly-once effect without 2PC: record a unique message_id in the same local transaction as the
// business write, ack the broker after commit. Redelivery hits the UNIQUE key and does nothing.
// Plain inline SVG, site tokens only, polygon arrowheads (no duplicate ids).
---
<figure class="txeo">
  <div class="txeo-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 420" role="img" aria-label="Two rows of four steps. Normal run: the broker delivers message m-17, the worker opens one local transaction that writes the business change and inserts m-17 under a UNIQUE key, commits, and only then acks the broker. Crash case: if the worker dies before the ack, the broker redelivers m-17, the insert hits the UNIQUE key, the business write is skipped, and the ack ends the loop, so the effect happens once.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="txeo-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Exactly-once effect with one local transaction</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Hiệu ứng đúng một lần chỉ bằng một transaction cục bộ</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="48" class="txeo-sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>The broker may deliver twice. The UNIQUE message_id makes the second delivery harmless.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Broker có thể gửi hai lần. Khoá UNIQUE trên message_id khiến lần gửi thứ hai vô hại.</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="80" class="txeo-sec ">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Normal run: write and record the id in one transaction</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chạy bình thường: ghi và lưu id trong một transaction</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="20" y="96" width="200" height="110" rx="4" class="txeo-box" />
    <text x="32" y="120" class="txeo-b"><tspan data-lang-en>1. Broker delivers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1. Broker gửi tin</tspan></text>
    <text x="32" y="144" class="txeo-m"><tspan data-lang-en>message_id = m-17</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>message_id = m-17</tspan></text>
    <text x="32" y="163" class="txeo-m"><tspan data-lang-en>payload: debit 5</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nội dung: trừ 5</tspan></text>
    <text x="32" y="190" class="txeo-note "><tspan data-lang-en>at-least-once</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>giao ít nhất một lần</tspan></text>
    <path d="M223,151 L240,151" class="txeo-arrow" /><polygon points="247,151 239,147 239,155" class="txeo-head" />
    <rect x="250" y="96" width="200" height="110" rx="4" class="txeo-box" />
    <text x="262" y="120" class="txeo-b"><tspan data-lang-en>2. Worker opens txn</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2. Worker mở transaction</tspan></text>
    <text x="262" y="144" class="txeo-m"><tspan data-lang-en>business write</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ghi nghiệp vụ</tspan></text>
    <text x="262" y="163" class="txeo-m"><tspan data-lang-en>INSERT m-17 (UNIQUE)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>INSERT m-17 (UNIQUE)</tspan></text>
    <text x="262" y="190" class="txeo-note "><tspan data-lang-en>same local database</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cùng một DB cục bộ</tspan></text>
    <path d="M453,151 L470,151" class="txeo-arrow" /><polygon points="477,151 469,147 469,155" class="txeo-head" />
    <rect x="480" y="96" width="200" height="110" rx="4" class="txeo-box is-ok" />
    <text x="492" y="120" class="txeo-b"><tspan data-lang-en>3. COMMIT</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>3. COMMIT</tspan></text>
    <text x="492" y="144" class="txeo-m"><tspan data-lang-en>both rows land</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cả hai dòng cùng vào</tspan></text>
    <text x="492" y="163" class="txeo-m"><tspan data-lang-en>or neither does</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hoặc không dòng nào</tspan></text>
    <text x="492" y="190" class="txeo-note "><tspan data-lang-en>atomic in one DB</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nguyên tử trong một DB</tspan></text>
    <path d="M683,151 L700,151" class="txeo-arrow" /><polygon points="707,151 699,147 699,155" class="txeo-head" />
    <rect x="710" y="96" width="170" height="110" rx="4" class="txeo-box" />
    <text x="722" y="120" class="txeo-b"><tspan data-lang-en>4. Ack to broker</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>4. Ack cho broker</tspan></text>
    <text x="722" y="144" class="txeo-m"><tspan data-lang-en>broker deletes m-17</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>broker xoá m-17</tspan></text>
    <text x="722" y="163" class="txeo-m"><tspan data-lang-en>(after the commit)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>(sau khi commit)</tspan></text>
    <text x="722" y="190" class="txeo-note "><tspan data-lang-en>ack comes last</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ack luôn đến cuối</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="268" class="txeo-sec is-bad">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Worker crashes before the ack: the redelivery is a no-op</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Worker sập trước khi ack: tin gửi lại không làm gì cả</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="20" y="284" width="200" height="110" rx="4" class="txeo-box is-bad" />
    <text x="32" y="308" class="txeo-b"><tspan data-lang-en>1. Broker redelivers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1. Broker gửi lại</tspan></text>
    <text x="32" y="332" class="txeo-m"><tspan data-lang-en>message_id = m-17</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>message_id = m-17</tspan></text>
    <text x="32" y="351" class="txeo-m"><tspan data-lang-en>no ack was seen</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chưa nhận được ack</tspan></text>
    <text x="32" y="378" class="txeo-note is-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>same message again</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cùng một tin nhắn</tspan></text>
    <path d="M223,339 L240,339" class="txeo-arrow" /><polygon points="247,339 239,335 239,343" class="txeo-head" />
    <rect x="250" y="284" width="200" height="110" rx="4" class="txeo-box" />
    <text x="262" y="308" class="txeo-b"><tspan data-lang-en>2. Worker opens txn</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2. Worker mở transaction</tspan></text>
    <text x="262" y="332" class="txeo-m"><tspan data-lang-en>INSERT m-17</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>INSERT m-17</tspan></text>
    <text x="262" y="351" class="txeo-m"><tspan data-lang-en>hits UNIQUE key</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đụng khoá UNIQUE</tspan></text>
    <text x="262" y="378" class="txeo-note "><tspan data-lang-en>id already stored</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>id đã được lưu</tspan></text>
    <path d="M453,339 L470,339" class="txeo-arrow" /><polygon points="477,339 469,335 469,343" class="txeo-head" />
    <rect x="480" y="284" width="200" height="110" rx="4" class="txeo-box is-ok" />
    <text x="492" y="308" class="txeo-b"><tspan data-lang-en>3. Skip the write</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>3. Bỏ qua bước ghi</tspan></text>
    <text x="492" y="332" class="txeo-m"><tspan data-lang-en>txn aborts or no-ops</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>huỷ hoặc bỏ qua</tspan></text>
    <text x="492" y="351" class="txeo-m"><tspan data-lang-en>nothing is debited</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không trừ thêm gì</tspan></text>
    <text x="492" y="378" class="txeo-note "><tspan data-lang-en>effect stays once</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hiệu ứng vẫn một lần</tspan></text>
    <path d="M683,339 L700,339" class="txeo-arrow" /><polygon points="707,339 699,335 699,343" class="txeo-head" />
    <rect x="710" y="284" width="170" height="110" rx="4" class="txeo-box" />
    <text x="722" y="308" class="txeo-b"><tspan data-lang-en>4. Ack to broker</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>4. Ack cho broker</tspan></text>
    <text x="722" y="332" class="txeo-m"><tspan data-lang-en>broker deletes m-17</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>broker xoá m-17</tspan></text>
    <text x="722" y="351" class="txeo-m"><tspan data-lang-en>loop ends</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>vòng lặp kết thúc</tspan></text>
    <text x="722" y="378" class="txeo-note "><tspan data-lang-en>safe to repeat</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chạy lại vẫn an toàn</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>No two-phase commit is needed: the database transaction holds both the business write and the processed-message record, and the broker is acked only after the commit. A crash between commit and ack causes a redelivery that the UNIQUE key turns into a no-op.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Không cần two-phase commit: transaction database giữ cả lệnh ghi nghiệp vụ lẫn bản ghi tin nhắn đã xử lý, và chỉ ack cho broker sau khi commit. Nếu sập giữa lúc commit và ack, tin được gửi lại sẽ bị khoá UNIQUE biến thành thao tác trống.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .txeo { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .txeo-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .txeo svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .txeo text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .txeo .txeo-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txeo .txeo-sub { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .txeo .txeo-sec { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txeo .txeo-sec.is-bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .txeo .txeo-b { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txeo .txeo-m { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .txeo .txeo-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .txeo .txeo-note.is-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 600; }
  .txeo-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .txeo-box.is-bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .txeo-box.is-ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .txeo-arrow { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .txeo-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .txeo figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5; }
</style>
